# Normalise text to LF in the repository. Checkouts still get native endings.
#
# The blobs here are already LF and always were — this file does not fix a
# problem, it pins the behaviour so none appears. Without it, normalisation
# depends on each contributor's core.autocrlf, and one clone committing CRLF is
# enough to produce a whole-file diff that hides the line which actually
# changed. On Windows checkouts the working tree is CRLF either way; that is
# autocrlf doing its job and is not a divergence.
* text=auto

# Binary — never touch these.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ico  binary
